# The menus and options on a desktop window: a lesson skipped, the modes,
# How to play, Settings (2D board on), the leaderboard (local bests for a
# guest), Practice on seed 4242 played on the 2D board (the hint, a pair,
# a draw, undo), pause and resume by Escape, Restart deal, Leave round,
# then the Daily started and left.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Summit Pyramid
frames 30
click =How to play
until 300 Pair to 14
frames 10
save sp-help
click =Back
until 300 Leaderboard
frames 10
click =Leaderboard
until 300 Personal bests (local)
frames 10
click =Back
until 300 Settings
frames 10
click =Settings
until 300 Color-vision palette
frames 10
click =2D board (screen-reader mode)
frames 10
save sp-settings
click =Back
until 300 Play
frames 10
click =Play
until 600 1/5
frames 20
click =Skip lesson
until 300 2/5
frames 10
click =Quit tutorial
until 300 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Practice — pick a difficulty
until 300 Seed (optional)
frames 10
click random
type 4242
frames 5
click Ridge
until 300 Practice — Ridge
frames 60
click =Hint
until 300 totals 14
frames 10
save sp-2d-board
click =6 of Hearts, exposed
frames 30
expect 540
click =Draw
frames 10
click =Undo
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
save sp-pause
key Escape 1
frames 20
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
click =Restart deal
until 300 Practice — Ridge
